---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service — Free Class Schedule Maker"
  description="Review terms of service, user rights, fair use policies, and export guidelines for Free Class Schedule Maker. Transparent standards for students and schools."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-10 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 shadow-xs">
        <span>Legal Agreement</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
        Last Updated: Academic Year 2026–2027
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing and utilizing <strong>Class Schedule Maker & Gap Optimizer</strong> ("the Service"), you agree to abide by these Terms of Service. If you do not accept these terms, you should discontinue use of the platform immediately.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">2. Educational Fair Use & Advisory Nature</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is provided as an open educational utility designed to assist collegiate students in planning academic schedules and visualizing time intervals. <em>The Service is not an official university registrar tool and does not formally register or enroll you in academic courses.</em>
      </p>
      <p>
        Users are solely responsible for verifying final course numbers, pre-requisite eligibility, section capacities, and official registration deadlines with their respective university registrar and academic advising offices.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">3. Intellectual Property & Calendar Export</h2>
      <p>
        The algorithms, design layout, and interface components are proprietary. Users are granted a revocable, non-exclusive license to export, print, and download generated schedules (.PNG and .ICS formats) for personal, non-commercial educational scheduling.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">4. Disclaimer of Warranties and Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. In no event shall Class Schedule Optimizer, its maintainers, or affiliates be liable for missed registration deadlines, full section enrollments, or academic advising conflicts resulting from the use of the platform.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">5. Governing Law & Modification</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to revise these terms at any time. Continued usage of the Service following revisions constitutes acceptance of the modified Terms of Service.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

